                "их",
                "них",
                "ним"
              ],
              "answer": "них",
              "hint": "After у, они becomes них.",
              "explanation": "After prepositions, они becomes них: У них есть дети."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "В парке _____ озеро. (There is a lake in the park.)",
              "promptEnglish": "There is a lake in the park.",
