              "answer": "есть",
              "hint": "Expressing that something exists.",
              "explanation": "Есть expresses existence: В парке есть озеро."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "У неё _____ волосы. (She has long hair - describing.)",
              "promptEnglish": "She has long hair.",
